  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.\n• Cut potato into fries.\n• Place on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil, sprinkle with mixed sesame seeds and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat.\n• Bake until tender, 20-25 minutes. TIP: If your oven tray is crowded, divide the fries between two trays.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/626764dbacb1de8ef40dd784/step-801d52b3.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop garlic.\n• Halve cherry tomatoes. Roughly chop coriander. Pick and slice mint leaves.\n• Zest lemon to get a good pinch, then slice into wedges.\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/626764dbacb1de8ef40dd784/step-077a30db.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium bowl, add chickpeas, the egg, mild curry paste and garlic. Thoroughly mash with a potato masher until chickpeas are broken up.\n• Add the flour, the milk, Thai stir-fry spice, coriander and 1/2 the mint. Combine until mixture is sticking together.\n• Using damp hands, form heaped spoonfuls of mixture into balls, then flatten into 1cm-thick patties (3-4 per person). Set aside on a plate.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/626764dbacb1de8ef40dd784/step-eba902df.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat enough olive oil to coat the base over medium-high heat.\n• When oil is hot, cook patties until golden, 3-4 minutes each side.\n• Transfer to a paper towel-lined plate. TIP: Don't flip before the time is up to ensure your patties can set. TIP: Add extra oil if needed to ensure the patties don't stick to the bottom of the pan.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/626764dbacb1de8ef40dd784/step-733f345b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a second medium bowl, combine mixed salad leaves, cherry tomatoes, Japanese dressing, a squeeze of lemon juice, remaining mint and a drizzle of olive oil. Set aside.\n• In a small bowl, combine sweet chilli sauce, mayonnaise and lemon zest.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/626764dbacb1de8ef40dd784/step-cabc8dde.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide sesame fries, tomato salad and Thai-spiced chickpea patties between plates.\n• Sprinkle with crispy shallots.\n• Serve with sweet chilli mayonnaise and any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/626764dbacb1de8ef40dd784/step-8f3f9204.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
